+written knowing it. The two arms did not hold the same bytes: the table
+arm has its slots and a hot table of slots/128 entries of 64 B, which is
+1/32 of the table's bytes again; the chick arm has the slots alone, and at
+load 1.15 (97.8% of slots, past the search's reach) each extension is a
+slot the churn wanted.
