+**B9b** (`TF_CHICK_BYTES=1`). The chick arm's table has 33/32 of the
+lines (Capacity 206,250 for a stream sized to 200,000): both arms hold the
+same bytes once the hot table is allocated. Everything else as B9.
+
+**Rule (written after B9's reading, before B9b's).** B9's clauses, the
+table arm as B9 read it:
+
+1. on S2 the chick arm counts at least 0.99 of the heavy keys' events
+   whole;
+2. on S1 at load 1.00 it evicts nothing, and of the promotions that must
+   move a mate at most 3% evict it;
+3. on S1 at load 1.15 its evictions are at most 1.10 of the table arm's
+   (16,022), and on S2 at load 1.15 at most 1.10 of the table arm's there
