+|---|---|---|---|
+| B8 despotic placement | the ideal despotic distribution: dominants at the good site | the filter, counted | fails its rule: hits in the alternate line 0.92 of the base where 0.50 was asked |
+| B8b earned territory | a territory contested once the claimant has shown what it is | the filter, counted | fails its rule: 0.66–0.85 of the base; the challenge adds 0.09–0.13 moves a hit. The cause is structural: the second line is paid by cold keys, which have no rank |
+| B9 the cuckoo chick | the chick takes a nest-mate's place where it hatched | a placement model | fails its rule: no refusal under squatters (heavy events counted whole 0.16 → 1.00) and nothing lost at design load, but 2.06 of the evictions at load 1.15 |
+| B9b the chick, at equal bytes | — | a placement model | fails its rule by 6 evicted keys in 4 horizons under squatters; evictions at load 1.15 1 against 16,022 (S1) and 0.88 (S2), most of it the bytes |
+| B10 arousal: a reclaimer with a deadline | interbout arousals of hibernators | postulate | not run |
+| B11 germ-line reset: a snapshot that rebases | the germ line resets the clock the soma keeps | postulate | not run |
